[i]Spikey and Jagged | Paprika Pressure | Undead Frogg and Buzzer | Deuteranopia and Maul Party | Kaneelbroodje and Jagged[/i]

[b]What is next?[/b]
Well much more programming, bug fixing and adding new features! Also I am definitely making a "serious" IRL bot, to hopefully actually meet some of you some day! I'm already looking forward to this!

The coming build will feature some small tweaks to spinners that I have been brewing on for a bit, it should bring spinners to a finally acceptable level that I might actually start working fully on other things! Some things in the works by me are: New pneumatic components, improved gyro, improvements to weld damage, improvements to hammer damage and perhaps... some more visual damage...? Money update?

I hope you enjoy it as much as I do, and if anything comes up, let me kn... tell kupa_ to fix it.
I love to joke around a lot, but I hope to inspire people with my passion, just like how I was inspired by someones passion!

Well, that's it from me for this dev diary, see you later!

DocDoyle
Robot Rumble 2
