[i]This updates header features BROCC built by myself and Oppresive built by @larsteampainfullyobvious fighting it out in the popular fan Wreckbots Arena available from the RR2 Discord.[/i]

Oh, why the broccoli you say?
Well... that's a funny story really. So, somewhere in middle school, working in shared google docs with a handful of classmates, you wouldn't have to wait long till someone pulled something dumb in the document. To retaliate, a friend and me made a script that would loop spam a picture into the document, to the point where google docs would be completely unable to open it.
This picture happened to be this beautiful broccoli you all know and love. (yeah you do.)
This became known as The Broccoli virus, but it didn't stop there. We took it way further and compiled it into an actual virus, nuking several school PC's with our dumb broccoli spammer causing memory leaks, full storage and whatnot.
Now, in case you are wondering, this is illegal, don't do it, it will get you in trouble haha. But the picture stuck with me ever since.

Also don't tell anyone I told you this.
